 Ceanothus × lobbianus {{small|Hook.}}
 Ceanothus × lorenzenii {{small|(Jeps.) McMinn}}
 Ceanothus × mendocinensis {{small|McMinn}}
 Ceanothus × rugosus {{small|Greene}}
 Ceanothus × serrulatus {{small|McMinn}}
 Ceanothus × vanrensselaeri Roof
